        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# The Library\n\nThe graphs the Twilite Zone publishes, on three shelves.\n\n**The language.** The Glossary, the fifteen Primitives and the Edge classes: what a graph is made of, and what its connections mean.\n\n**Build.** The Templates, the Document Starter, and the Node classes a node can be made from.\n\n**Read.** Navigation, the Authoring contract and the Contracts.\n\nThis graph is a collection. Each tile is a portal it contains, and what a tile shows (its name, its description, its colour) is read from the graph behind it, so nothing here is a copy."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791502752029,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
